    {
      "id": "software",
      "label": "Software release resources",
      "inNavigation": false,
      "introduction": "<p>OpenStack is an<span>&#xa0;open source software for building public, private, and hybrid clouds,&#xa0;</span>developed and released around 6-month cycles. After the initial release, additional stable point releases are released in each release series. Here you will find logos, talking points and supporting collateral for each release.</p>",
      "cards": [
        {
          "id": "release-1",
          "title": "Rocky",
          "description": "<p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-a5c415bd-7fff-d9f0-d657-cdde994b0a03\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">18th release of OpenStack addresses new demands for infrastructure driven by modern use cases like AI, machine learning, NFV and edge computing, by starting with a bare metal foundation and enabling containers, virtual machines and GPUs</span></p>",
          "image": "/assets/marketing/rocky-release-logo.png",
          "imageAlt": "rocky release logo",
          "action": {
            "label": "View Release Details >",
            "url": "https://www.openstack.org/software/rocky"
          },
          "videoId": "3414FRaw6eE",
          "resources": [
            {
              "label": "Logo",
              "url": "/assets/marketing/rocky-release-logo.png"
            },
            {
              "label": "Presentation",
              "url": "/assets/marketing/Rocky-Release-Preview.pdf"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "release-2",
          "title": "Queens",
          "description": "<p>OpenStack Queens is the 17th release of OpenStack, and focuses on adding operational enhancements like Ironic Rescue Mode and HOT drag and drop templates, while supporting emerging use cases like edge, container management, HPC and AI through features like vGPU support, block storage multi-attach, OpenStack-Helm, Kuryr CNI daemon, and more.</p>",
          "image": "/assets/marketing/openstackqueens.png",
          "imageAlt": "OpenStack Queens",
          "action": {
            "label": "View Release Details >",
            "url": "/software/queens"
          },
          "videoId": "Lt8EhrDg4lU",
          "resources": [
            {
              "label": "Logo",
              "url": "/assets/marketing/openstackqueens.png"
            },
            {
              "label": "Presentation",
              "url": "/assets/marketing/OpenStackQueens2018-Marketing-Preview.pptx"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "release-3",
          "title": "Pike",
          "description": "<p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-1e9e08bc-1522-7a56-7c69-164d164fa486\"><span>OpenStack Pike, the 16th release of the most widely deployed open source infrastructure software, showcases the OpenStack project&#x2019;s increasing modularity. With individual projects supporting standalone use and enhanced project integration, Pike gives OpenStack users greater flexibility and freedom.</span></span></p>",
          "image": "/assets/marketing/openstack-pike-logo.png",
          "imageAlt": "openstack pike logo",
          "action": {
            "label": "View Release Details >",
            "url": ""
          },
          "videoId": "q9dvxfEQ_Ic",
          "resources": [
            {
              "label": "Logo",
              "url": "/assets/marketing/openstack-pike-logo.png"
            },
            {
              "label": "Presentation",
              "url": "/assets/marketing/OpenStackPike-Marketing-Community-Preview.pptx"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "release-4",
          "title": "Ocata",
          "description": "<p>Ocata offers greater scalability, manageability and an enhanced user experience in this stabilization release cycle.&#xa0;</p>",
          "image": "/assets/marketing/openstack-ocata-release-logo-480.png",
          "imageAlt": "openstack ocata release logo 480",
          "action": {
            "label": "View Release Details >",
            "url": "https://www.openstack.org/software/ocata/"
          },
          "videoId": "",
          "resources": [
            {
              "label": "Logo",
              "url": "/assets/marketing/openstack-ocata-release-logo-480.png"
            },
            {
              "label": "Presentation",
              "url": "/assets/marketing/OpenStackOcata2017.pptx"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "release-5",
          "title": "Newton",
          "description": "<p>Newton, OpenStack&#x2019;s 14th software release, offers better scalability, resiliency and an enhanced user experience for managing virtual machines, bare metal and containers with one platform.</p>",
          "image": "/assets/marketing/newston-revised.png",
          "imageAlt": "newston revised",
          "action": {
            "label": "View Release Details >",
            "url": "http://www.openstack.org/software/newton/"
